Add ``OP_ENABLE_KTLS``, ``OP_ENABLE_MIDDLEBOX_COMPAT``, ``OP_IGNORE_UNEXPECTED_EOF``,
``OP_NO_RENEGOTIATION``, ``OP_NO_TICKET``, ``OP_NO_TLSv1_3``,
``VERIFY_ALLOW_PROXY_CERTS``, ``VERIFY_X509_PARTIAL_CHAIN`` and
``VERIFY_X509_TRUSTED_FIRST`` to the ``ssl`` brain, so that pylint no longer reports
them as missing members of ``ssl``.

Refs #3444
